@startuml
title Safe Refactoring Workflow

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ActivityFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

|#E8F4FD| Refactoring Workflow |
start

:Ensure comprehensive\ntest suite exists; <<#4A90D9>>

note right
  Tests are the safety net
  for refactoring
end note

repeat

  :Make ONE small\nbehavior-preserving change; <<#69DB7C>>

  :Run all tests; <<#FFA94D>>

  if (Tests pass?) then (YES)

    :Commit the change; <<#37B24D>>

    note right
      Frequent commits allow
      easy rollback
    end note

  else (NO)

    :Undo the change\nimmediately; <<#FF6B6B>>

    note right
      Try a different
      approach
    end note

  endif

  if (Code cleaner?) then (Continue)
  else (Done)
  endif

repeat while (More improvements needed?) is (Yes)

:Review final result\nIs the code cleaner?; <<#4A90D9>>

stop

@enduml
